                        "content": "14. 绝大多数比赛都采用“(2n-1)局 n 胜制”的规则，但也有一些项目，比如冰壶运动，其整个比赛通常是进行偶数局。现有甲、乙两名同学进行一项趣味项目的比赛，两人约定比赛规则为：共进行   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "2n(n \\in \\mathbf{N}_{+})"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  局，谁赢的局数大于 n 局，谁就获得最终胜利。已知每局比赛中，甲获胜的概率均为   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "p\\left(0 < p < \\frac{1}{2}\\right)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，乙获胜的概率均为   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "(1 - p)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 。记甲赢得整个比赛的概率为   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "P_{2n}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 。若   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "p = \\frac{2}{5}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，则   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "P_{4} - P_{2} ="
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ____ ，若   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "p = \\frac{5}{12}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，则当 2n = ____ 时，  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "P_{2n}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  最大。"
                    }
                ]
            },
